      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i don't even exist anymore. everyone in my group just... stopped talking to me. no big fight, no drama, just silence. it’s like i’ve been deleted from their lives and i’m just wandering around as a ghost while everyone else keeps living. it’s so heavy.",
